### Nattile API — sample requests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@base = http://localhost:5000
@districtId = REPLACE_WITH_DISTRICT_ID
@blockId = REPLACE_WITH_BLOCK_ID
@villageId = REPLACE_WITH_VILLAGE_ID

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List districts
GET {{base}}/api/locations/districts

### List blocks in a district
GET {{base}}/api/locations/blocks?district={{districtId}}

### List villages in a block
GET {{base}}/api/locations/villages?block={{blockId}}

### Home (village-first aggregation)
GET {{base}}/api/home?villageId={{villageId}}

### Categories
GET {{base}}/api/categories?kind=business

### Businesses (filtered by village)
GET {{base}}/api/businesses?village={{villageId}}&category=supermarket

### Search
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=bakery&village={{villageId}}

### Emergency contacts
GET {{base}}/api/emergency-contacts?village={{villageId}}

### Announcements
GET {{base}}/api/announcements?village={{villageId}}

### Login (seeded super admin)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "+919999999999", "password": "admin123" }

### Authenticated: current user
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Authenticated: create a business (district/block derived from village)
POST {{base}}/api/businesses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "name": "New Shop",
  "category": "grocery",
  "phone": "+919447011111",
  "address": "Main Road, Omassery",
  "village": "{{villageId}}",
  "isFeatured": true
}
